OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry, but often cloudy. A
OL,6,Fchance of some rain across the north
OL,7,Fand west of the region during the
OL,8,Fmorning. Skies clearing from the west
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon, bring plenty of
OL,10,Fsunny spells. Temperatures around
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry night to come with
OL,14,Fplenty of clear spells and light
OL,15,Fwinds. Temperatures will drop quickly
OL,16,Fto low single figures in rural and
OL,17,Fsheltered spots. Grass frost likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
