OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FHazy sunny spells through
OL,6,Fmuch of Thursday and staying dry for
OL,7,Fall. Light winds with temperatures
OL,8,Faround, or just above average for the
OL,9,Ftime of year.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,12,Fmoves east on Friday. Brighter with
OL,13,Fshowers later, but staying around
OL,14,Faverage for temperatures. Unsettled
OL,15,Fconditions continue through the
OL,16,Fweekend with rain advancing eastwards.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
